{"id":46,"title":"解答: 数字拼接","summary":"给出 \"数字拼接 \"挑战的参考答案。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8d3c5d7ef9c311ebbc3d3af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 答案","text_html":"<h2>答案</h2>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8d3c5f7cf9c311ebbc3d3af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"def rep_cat(x, y):\n    return str(x) * 10 + str(y) * 5\n\n\nprint(rep_cat(3, 4))\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8d3c5fc2f9c311ebbc3d3af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 解释\n\n为了将整数转换成字符串，可以使用`str()`方法。\n\n`*`操作符非常适合于将一个字符串的值复制一定的次数。\n\n使用`+`运算符可以很容易地将两个字符串串联起来。\n\n最后，通过`return`语句从函数中返回。","text_html":"<h2>解释</h2>\n<p>为了将整数转换成字符串，可以使用<code>str()</code>方法。</p>\n<p><code>*</code>操作符非常适合于将一个字符串的值复制一定的次数。</p>\n<p>使用<code>+</code>运算符可以很容易地将两个字符串串联起来。</p>\n<p>最后，通过<code>return</code>语句从函数中返回。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2}],"status":"undo","course_no":"002","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/002/page/46"}
